{"t":"Gift of Life","s":"gift-of-life-2a937","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Gift_of_Life_7b3c80.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Gift of Life</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Gift of Life\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gift_of_Life_7b3c80.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Healing Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Cooldown_62226b.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Healing</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30 hours/20 hours/10 hours</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monk</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">300</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Other Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vocation%20Promotion\">Promotion Spells</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"wheelspell\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Other Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheel%20of%20Destiny\">Wheel of Destiny Spells</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"passivespell\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Other Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Passive Spells</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.10.12852<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 28, 2022<br/>Winter Update 2022</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Under certain circumstances, heals the player before taking otherwise fatal damage, giving them a second chance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>If an attack were to kill you but the overkill damage amounts to less than a certain percentage of your maximum health, you will first heal yourself for that same percentage of hit points and only afterwards will the damage be applied. In addition, all your spell cooldowns are reduced by 60 seconds. Attacks that deal <a href=\"#/wiki/Agony%20Damage\">agony damage</a> do not trigger this perk. It is technically not a spell, is casted automatically when the effect triggers, and costs no mana.\n</p><p>The cooldown of this perk is only reduced while the character has this perk available and has a battle sign. The cooldown timer will stop going down immediately when the battle sign is lost, either because one minute passed since it was triggered or because the character has entered a <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Zone\">Protection Zone</a>. The current cooldown can be checked by adding Gift of Life to an <a href=\"#/wiki/Action%20Bars\">action button</a> (right click and select \"Assign Passive Ability\"). \n</p><p>This is a Revelation Perk granted through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheel%20of%20Destiny\">Wheel of Destiny</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Gift of Life</th>\n<th>Stage 1</th>\n<th>Stage 2</th>\n<th>Stage 3\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Overkill damage\n</th>\n<td>20% of max HP</td>\n<td>25% of max HP</td>\n<td>30% of max HP\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Global spell cooldown reduced\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\">60 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cooldown\n</th>\n<td>30 hours</td>\n<td>20 hours</td>\n<td>10 hours\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Mana Recovery\n</th>\n<td>20% of max mana</td>\n<td>25% of max mana</td>\n<td>30% of max mana\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 added a mana recovery effect to it.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Healing_Spells\">Healing Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Bruise Bane</li><li>Cure Bleeding</li><li>Cure Burning</li><li>Cure Curse</li><li>Cure Electrification</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Cure Poison</a></li><li>Divine Healing</li><li>Fair Wound Cleansing</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heal%20Friend\">Heal Friend</a></li><li>Intense Healing</li><li>Intense Recovery</li><li>Intense Wound Cleansing</li><li>Light Healing</li><li>Magic Patch</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mass%20Healing\">Mass Healing</a></li><li>Mass Spirit Mend</li><li>Nature's Embrace</li><li>Recovery</li><li>Restoration</li><li>Restore Balance</li><li>Salvation</li><li>Spirit Mend</li><li>Ultimate Healing</li><li>Wound Cleansing</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["make-believe-quest"]}